{
	"info": {
		"name": "Womans Day API",
		"description": "Corporate March 8th event API.\n\n## Response Models\n\n### AuthResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 3600\n}\n```\n\n### UserResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"hasAvatar\": true,\n  \"earned\": 1500\n}\n```\n\n### MeResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"balance\": 1500,\n  \"hasAvatar\": true\n}\n```\n\n### TaskResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Selfie\",\n  \"description\": \"...\",\n  \"reward\": 500,\n  \"type\": \"photo\",\n  \"collaborative\": true,\n  \"myStatus\": \"pending\",\n  \"mySubmission\": { ...SubmissionResponse }\n}\n```\n\n### SubmissionResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"submitterId\": 2,\n  \"submitterLogin\": \"masha\",\n  \"submitterFirstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"submitterLastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"submitterDepartment\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"participants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"pendingParticipants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"text\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAtEpoch\": 1741428600000,\n  \"photoIds\": [1, 2]\n}\n```\n\n### BudgetResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"totalBudget\": 12500,\n  \"approvedBudget\": 3200\n}\n```\n\n### Error Response\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"Login is already taken\"\n}\n```\n\n## Statuses\n- `notStarted` - user has not submitted\n- `waitingForParticipants` - waiting for invited participants\n- `invited` - user has a pending invitation\n- `pending` - awaiting admin review\n- `approved` - approved by admin\n- `rejected` - rejected by admin\n- `cancelled` - all participants declined",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080"
		},
		{
			"key": "accessToken",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "refreshToken",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{accessToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"password\": \"securepass1\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" }
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"adminpassword\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" }
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Refresh Token",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" }
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Users",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get Me",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "users", "me"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Profile",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Petrova\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "users", "me"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Upload Avatar",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "avatar",
									"type": "file",
									"src": ""
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/avatar",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "users", "me", "avatar"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Avatar",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/1/avatar",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "users", "1", "avatar"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get All Users",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "users"]
						},
						"description": "Admin sees all users with `earned` field. Regular users see only non-admin users without `earned`."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Tasks",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All Tasks",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Task by ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "1"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Submit Task (solo)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{ "key": "text", "value": "My answer text", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "photos", "type": "file", "src": "" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/submit",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "1", "submit"]
						},
						"description": "Solo submission. Status immediately becomes `pending`."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Submit Task (collaborative)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{ "key": "text", "value": "Our team answer", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "photos", "type": "file", "src": "" },
								{ "key": "participantIds", "value": "2", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "participantIds", "value": "3", "type": "text" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/submit",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "1", "submit"]
						},
						"description": "Collaborative submission. Status becomes `waitingForParticipants` until all invited users accept."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Accept Invitation",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/submissions/1/respond?accept=true",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "submissions", "1", "respond"],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "accept", "value": "true" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Accept a co-participation invitation. When all participants accept, submission status becomes `pending`."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Decline Invitation",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/submissions/1/respond?accept=false",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "submissions", "1", "respond"],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "accept", "value": "false" }
							]
						},
						"description": "Decline a co-participation invitation. If all decline and no one accepted, submission is `cancelled`."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Budget",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/budget",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "budget"]
						},
						"description": "Available to all authenticated users. Returns total and approved budget."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Photo",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/photos/1",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "photos", "1"]
						},
						"description": "Returns photo binary. Users can only access photos from their submissions. Admin can access all."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Admin",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All Submissions",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/submissions",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "submissions"]
						},
						"description": "Optional query param: ?status=PENDING|APPROVED|REJECTED|WAITING_FOR_PARTICIPANTS|CANCELLED"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Submissions by Status",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/submissions?status=PENDING",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "submissions"],
							"query": [
								{ "key": "status", "value": "PENDING" }
							]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Approve Submission",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"approved\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/submissions/1/review",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "submissions", "1", "review"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Reject Submission",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"approved\": false\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/submissions/1/review",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "submissions", "1", "review"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Monitoring (Admin only)",
			"item": [
